        {
          "kind": "comment",
          "text": "【主線 CH5 5-1 五日無戰事篇】"
        },
        {
          "kind": "background.show",
          "role": "image",
          "code": 1,
          "image": "ms_bg_vehicle_interior.png",
          "loc": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 250
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平從黑色高級加長禮車醒來之後，發現道路的周圍被警察圍了起來"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "(看來有大人物要來了啊)",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
            "expression": "normal"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "對著周圍的環境，梗平如此想著"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "等車開到了碳烤蜜瓜兔子前方後，禮車停了下來"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "貝琪",
          "text": "昨天的事情，我願意",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_becky_normal.png",
            "expression": "normal"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "貝琪",
          "text": "你一定要回來找我喔",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_becky_normal.png",
            "expression": "normal"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "喔？真的嗎？太好了",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_smile_portrait.png",
            "expression": "smile"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "貝琪",
          "text": "我這邊也要先去籌備一些事情，就先說聲再見了",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_becky_normal.png",
            "expression": "normal"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "貝琪面帶笑容地將梗平送下了車，然後走到了警察的旁邊說了幾句話"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "警察們很自然的讓出了一條通道，前方正是炭烤蜜瓜兔子"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "貝琪揮手送別了梗平後，就上了車揚長而去"
        },
        {
          "kind": "comment",
          "text": "【過場】"
        },
        {
          "kind": "background.show",
          "role": "image",
          "code": 1,
          "image": "CH1_L360.png",
          "loc": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 250
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "在智乃困惑的眼光中，梗平熟練的拿起了掃帚開始進行清掃工作"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "又是一樣的早晨，一樣的清掃、一樣的蹭了早午餐"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "接下來該做甚麼好呢",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
            "expression": "normal"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "感覺接下來會特別忙，先把想做的事情做完好了",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
            "expression": "normal"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平將工具歸了位後，離開了炭烤蜜瓜兔子"
        },
        {
          "kind": "character.exchange",
          "destination": {
            "floorId": "main_ch5_1_exchange_1",
            "loc": [6, 10],
            "direction": "up",
            "time": 500
          },
          "targetCount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
