        {
          "kind": "bgm.play",
          "name": "BGMRakisuta.mp3"
        },
        {
          "kind": "background.show",
          "role": "image",
          "code": 1,
          "image": "ms_bg_vehicle_interior.png",
          "loc": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "comment",
          "text": "【主線 CH5 5-1 五日無戰事篇（交流後）】"
        },
        {
          "kind": "background.show",
          "role": "image",
          "code": 1,
          "image": "CH1_L42.png",
          "loc": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 250
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "呼，看起來都處理得差不多了",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
            "expression": "normal"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "不過總感覺今天好像少了什麼",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png",
            "expression": "surprised"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "沒錯，秋葉原的熱意，再臨"
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "CH2_L32.png",
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 250
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "肥宅與梗平的羈絆還在繼續，肥宅朝著梗平發起了衝鋒"
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 150
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "天啊，梗平閃過了肥宅的撞擊"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平，他勝利了"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "哈，英雄不會因為同一個招式倒下第四次！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png",
            "expression": "surprised"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "當梗平宣布勝利時，從肥宅的後方死角出現了更多的肥宅"
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "CH5_L50.png",
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 250
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "這就是肥宅們三位一體無法迴避的噴射氣流攻擊"
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 150
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "效果顯著，梗平失去戰鬥能力"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "啊！！！！！！！！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png",
            "expression": "surprised"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "我的鼻子啊！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_surprised_portrait.png",
            "expression": "surprised"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "可惡，我一定要找到方法解決你們",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_serious_portrait.png",
            "expression": "angry"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "或許是為了回應這麼想的梗平，手機恰到好處的響了起來"
        },
        {
          "kind": "background.show",
          "role": "image",
          "code": 1,
          "image": "CH1_L42.png",
          "loc": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 250
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東山",
          "text": "好，從剛剛救出來了IB的哥哥得到了很有用的資訊"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "什麼？他已經被救出來了！？"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "那我跟小朋友們的羈絆與約定該怎麼辦啊"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東山",
          "text": "那種東西怎麼樣都好吧"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "可......可惡"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東山",
          "text": "好消息是我們知道肥宅們為甚麼會這樣了"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東山",
          "text": "他們是因為一個叫「聖物」的東西不見了才會發瘋的"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東山",
          "text": "所以只要找回聖物就好了"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "蘭斯",
          "text": "那壞消息是什麼呢？"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東山",
          "text": "聖物被掛在拍賣網站上，要200萬"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "克莉絲",
          "text": "多...多少？"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東山",
          "text": "200萬，所以沒錯，各位我們要趕快去籌錢了"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東山",
          "text": "我要去想辦法賺錢了，再見"
        },
        {
          "kind": "background.show",
          "role": "image",
          "code": 1,
          "image": "CH1_L42.png",
          "loc": [
            0,
            0
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 250
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "(200萬啊，好可怕的價格)",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_panic_portrait.png",
            "expression": "panic"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "(該怎麼籌到啊......)",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
            "expression": "normal"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "choice",
          "prompt": "請選擇。",
          "options": [
            {
              "text": "這麼說來，小鋼珠是不是挺好賺的",
              "events": [
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "(這種時候要賺到這麼多的錢的話只能這樣了)",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
                    "expression": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "梗平選擇了捷徑(?)"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "comment",
                  "text": "【過場】"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "bgm.play",
                  "name": "BGMKanu.mp3"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "background.show",
                  "role": "image",
                  "code": 1,
                  "image": "CH2_L258.png",
                  "loc": [
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "opacity": 1,
                  "time": 250
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "梗平充新踏入了電子遊樂場，那個他永遠的失去了1000円的地方"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "梗平學著那個警察坐到了機台前，投入了自己的錢"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "總感覺，好快樂",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
                    "expression": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "在一陣勁爆的假面騎士特效後，螢幕上出現的數字讓梗平震驚不已"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "原來，錢是這麼好賺的嗎？",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
                    "expression": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "不知道甚麼時候出現的警察站在了梗平的身旁"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "警察",
                  "text": "夥伴，你來了啊",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "ms_portrait_police_normal.png",
                    "expression": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "在下來了",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
                    "expression": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "警察",
                  "text": "看來你沒有忘記那個美好的下午呢",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "ms_portrait_police_normal.png",
                    "expression": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "梗平",
                  "text": "這樣的地方在下怎麼沒有早點發現呢",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png",
                    "expression": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "警察",
                  "text": "時間還不算晚，讓我們去追逐我們的光吧",
                  "portrait": {
                    "code": 20,
                    "image": "ms_portrait_police_normal.png",
                    "expression": "normal"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "kind": "image.show",
                  "role": "cg",
                  "code": 30,
                  "image": "CH5_L97.png",
                  "loc": [
                    112,
                    50,
                    320,
                    220
                  ],
                  "opacity": 1,
                  "time": 250
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "梗平與警察一同踏上了在小鋼珠店奮戰的道路，成功獲取了可觀的資金"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "image.hide",
                  "code": 30,
                  "time": 150
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "至於幾個小時後就欠下了幾十萬，被迫進入地下礦場打工就是後話了"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "在暗無天日的礦場打工，並正面擊潰了地下賭博帝國之後"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "賭神梗平重新見到了地面上的太陽，但Comike早已結束"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "梗平，錯過了Comike"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "image.show",
                  "role": "cg",
                  "code": 30,
                  "image": "CH1_L119.png",
                  "loc": [
                    112,
                    50,
                    320,
                    220
                  ],
                  "opacity": 1,
                  "time": 250
                },
                {
                  "kind": "dialogue",
                  "speaker": "BE",
                  "text": "梗平的賭博默示錄"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "image.hide",
                  "code": 30,
                  "time": 150
                },
                {
                  "kind": "goto",
                  "floorId": "main_ch5_1_exchange_1",
                  "loc": [
                    6,
                    10
                  ],
                  "direction": "up",
                  "time": 0
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "既然如此，答案只有一個了…我將效忠於您",
              "events": [
                {
                  "kind": "bgm.play",
                  "name": "BGMWORC.mp3"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "梗平決定將今天自己剩下的所有時間投入到書店的打工中"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
                  "text": "如果一小時2000，他只需要工作區區1000小時就可以賺到200萬了"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "comment",
                  "text": "【過場】"
                },
                {
                  "kind": "background.show",
                  "role": "image",
                  "code": 1,
                  "image": "CH2_L295.png",
                  "loc": [
                    0,
                    0
                  ],
                  "opacity": 1,
                  "time": 250
                },
                {
                  "kind": "narration",
